 831	  /* Formats the questionnaire responses so it can be mapped to the debtor file keys
 832	   * Will use the option label instead of the key for fields with options (except for the 2 specified below)
 833	   * List rows are turned into listRowResponses - where the key is the list row item key and index is the row that it is in the list
 834	   * For example a table will how 2 rows (debtor 1 and debtor 2) so to look at the debtor 1 name look at index 0 and the key for the name field in the list
 835	   */
